    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d535">

                <pb facs="0489" n="373" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg373"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/688.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister to the Dominican
                        Republic</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-10-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Regarding additional naval vessels as per your October 14 and October 20, the
                    naval auxiliary <hi rendition="#italic">Caesar</hi> arrives about the 24th.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
